#. <CLT 4>ここが…学校エリアの２階…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is...the 2nd floor of the school.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかしたら、
#. ここに何か手掛かりがあるかもしれない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe there's some kind of clue here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…いや、きっとあるはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yeah, I'm sure of it. There's gotta be something\n"
"here...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>女子トイレだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is the girls bathroom.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな所に入ったら最後…
#. みんなから軽蔑されて終わりだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I ever took one step in there, I'd become a total\n"
"creep in everyone's eyes, and that'd be it for me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>シャッターが降りてる…
#. この上もあるって事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The gate's blocking my way. So there's still another\n"
"floor...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まだ、すべてを開放した訳じゃないんだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which means not everything has opened up yet...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
